{"nodes": [{"id": "supabase_tests_opening_balance_test_opening_balance_test", "label": "opening_balance_test (card ^ref-62)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "supabase/tests/opening_balance_test.sql", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Failure-case suite for fn_record_opening_balance and fn_set_opening_cost, TC-10 ... TC-24, TC-38, TC-39 and TC-41 of TDD-opening-balance.md. This path has no expectation to check itself against \u2014 an opening row IS the expectation \u2014 so the guards are all there is. Asserts: an opening lot must carry a smoke date or it sorts as newest stock and the oldest meat never leaves (R46); the cut-off must be configured, not defaulted, or the ADR-021 window does not exist (ADR-023, BR23); an Owner cannot count a freezer they are not at; no price reaches the L3 who counted the meat (BR15, R20); a dropped connection cannot post the count twice (R4); and no cost lands on the ledger row (ADR-003, Seam 1)."}], "edges": [{"source": "supabase_tests_opening_balance_test_opening_balance_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_record_opening_balance_fn_record_opening_balance", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/opening_balance_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_opening_balance_test_opening_balance_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_set_opening_cost_fn_set_opening_cost", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/opening_balance_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_opening_balance_test_opening_balance_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_post_ledger_fn_post_ledger", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/opening_balance_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source"